      "claim": "Direct absolute oral bioavailability measurements in transferable contexts are >=20%: verapamil in cirrhosis 30-52.3% (C11, C13, C15, C43, C48, C55, C58, C127) and valbenazine approximately 49% in humans (C28).",
      "card_ids": ["C11","C13","C15","C43","C48","C55","C58","C127","C28"]
